{"seq":1,"slug":"suspense-account-posting","title":"挂账分录与过渡账户","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/suspense-writeoff/suspense-account-posting","wordCount":1737,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"挂账分录与过渡账户\">挂账分录与过渡账户</h1><p>差异被识别出来的那一刻起，账上就存在一处不平。很多团队的处理方式是&quot;等查清楚了再记账&quot;，这在单笔差异上看似省事，在系统层面却会积累成一个无法收场的问题：周末和月末结账时，账实差额会集中爆发，而那时最需要的调查窗口已经关闭。挂账的意义就是在差异被发现的第一时间，用一条平衡的分录把&quot;不确定&quot;显式地记到账上——让它可见、可统计、可被账龄管理，等有了结论再核销出去。会计上把这种临时承载&quot;待分析、待分类&quot;金额的账户称为暂记账户（suspense account），它的用途正是临时承载存疑分录与差额，等待分析与永久分类（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suspense_account\">Suspense account</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-挂账是记账-不是标记\">核心概念：挂账是记账，不是标记</h2><p>一个常见误解是把挂账当成&quot;给差异加个状态&quot;。真正的挂账会产生分录，而分录必须遵守复式记账的约束：每笔业务至少涉及两个账户，一个借记一个贷记，金额相等，从而维持&quot;资产 = 负债 + 所有者权益&quot;恒等（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Double-entry_bookkeeping\">Double-entry bookkeeping</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;差异被发现&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;生成挂账分录&lt;br/&gt;借贷平衡&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C{&quot;差异方向&quot;}&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;短款(我方少)&quot;| D[&quot;借:待查差异-短款&lt;br/&gt;贷:渠道应收/清算差额&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;长款(我方多)&quot;| E[&quot;借:渠道应付/清算差额&lt;br/&gt;贷:待查差异-长款&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;差异进入账龄管理&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;调查结论&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;核销分录&lt;br/&gt;反向冲销待查差异&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I[&quot;结转至损益/应收/应付&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"差异被发现\"] --&gt; B[\"生成挂账分录&lt;br/&gt;借贷平衡\"]\n  B --&gt; C{\"差异方向\"}\n  C --&gt;|\"短款(我方少)\"| D[\"借:待查差异-短款&lt;br/&gt;贷:渠道应收/清算差额\"]\n  C --&gt;|\"长款(我方多)\"| E[\"借:渠道应付/清算差额&lt;br/&gt;贷:待查差异-长款\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"差异进入账龄管理\"]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[\"调查结论\"]\n  G --&gt; H[\"核销分录&lt;br/&gt;反向冲销待查差异\"]\n  H --&gt; I[\"结转至损益/应收/应付\"]</pre><p>三个必须记住的性质：挂账分录<strong>必须与差异记录一一对应</strong>（不能批量轧差）；<strong>必须幂等</strong>（同一条差异重复消费不产生第二条分录）；<strong>必须可反向冲销</strong>（核销就是挂账的反向分录，而不是&quot;删除挂账&quot;）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过渡账户的设计维度\">过渡账户的设计维度</h2><h3 id=\"按什么维度开账户\">按什么维度开账户</h3><p>过渡账户的粒度选择直接影响后续所有环节的可分析性。四种常见的开法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>开法</th>\n<th>账户数</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一&quot;待查差异&quot;科目</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>最简单</td>\n<td>无法按维度分析，账龄看板只有一根柱子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按差异类型分</td>\n<td>5–6</td>\n<td>直接支撑类型维度的趋势分析</td>\n<td>一个差异若类型待定，需要先挂&quot;未明&quot;再重分类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按渠道分</td>\n<td>N（渠道数）</td>\n<td>支持渠道治理，能直接算出各渠道挂账余额</td>\n<td>渠道增删会带来科目维护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型 × 渠道 二维</td>\n<td>5×N</td>\n<td>分析能力最强</td>\n<td>科目数膨胀，需要科目自动创建机制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中的折中是：<strong>按差异类型分主科目，渠道作为子维度记录在分录的辅助核算字段上</strong>。这样科目表稳定，而分析能力不受损——因为余额可以按辅助维度聚合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE gl_journal_entry (&#10;  entry_id       BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  posting_id     BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES gl_posting(posting_id),&#10;  account_code   TEXT   NOT NULL,&#10;  auxiliary      JSONB  NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;,&#10;  dr_cr          CHAR(1) NOT NULL CHECK (dr_cr IN (&#39;D&#39;,&#39;C&#39;)),&#10;  amount_minor   BIGINT NOT NULL CHECK (amount_minor &gt; 0),&#10;  currency       CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  posted_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  CONSTRAINT dr_cr_valid CHECK (dr_cr IN (&#39;D&#39;,&#39;C&#39;))&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE gl_posting (&#10;  posting_id   BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  source_type  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  source_id    BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  idempotency_key TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,&#10;  reversal_of  BIGINT REFERENCES gl_posting(posting_id),&#10;  created_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> gl_journal_entry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  posting_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gl_posting(posting_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  account_code   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  auxiliary      JSONB  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dr_cr          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dr_cr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'D'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'C'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount_minor   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (amount_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  posted_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dr_cr_valid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dr_cr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'D'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'C'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> gl_posting</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  posting_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_type  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idempotency_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reversal_of  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gl_posting(posting_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>gl_posting.idempotency_key</code> 是幂等性的落点。幂等键的语义是&quot;同一个键的重复请求返回同一个结果&quot;，Stripe 的实现方式是保存首次请求的状态码与响应体，同一键的后续请求返回相同结果，并且在参数与原请求不一致时报错以防误用（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/api/idempotent_requests\">Idempotent requests</a>）。挂账分录需要同样的性质：幂等键由 <code>source_type + source_id + posting_kind</code> 组成，重复消费同一条差异不会产生第二条分录，而参数不一致会被发现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"借贷平衡的强制校验\">借贷平衡的强制校验</h3><p>平衡校验必须在<strong>记账批次（posting）级别</strong>做，且随状态码判断自动化程度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION post_batch(p_posting_id BIGINT) RETURNS void&#10;LANGUAGE plpgsql AS $$&#10;DECLARE v_dr BIGINT; v_cr BIGINT; v_n INT;&#10;BEGIN&#10;  SELECT coalesce(sum(amount_minor) FILTER (WHERE dr_cr=&#39;D&#39;), 0),&#10;         coalesce(sum(amount_minor) FILTER (WHERE dr_cr=&#39;C&#39;), 0),&#10;         count(*)&#10;    INTO v_dr, v_cr, v_n&#10;    FROM gl_journal_entry WHERE posting_id = p_posting_id;&#10;&#10;  IF v_n = 0 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION &#39;empty posting %&#39;, p_posting_id; END IF;&#10;  IF v_dr &lt;&gt; v_cr THEN&#10;    RAISE EXCEPTION &#39;unbalanced posting %: dr=% cr=%&#39;, p_posting_id, v_dr, v_cr;&#10;  END IF;&#10;  UPDATE gl_posting SET posted_at = now() WHERE posting_id = p_posting_id;&#10;END $$;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> post_batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p_posting_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RETURNS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> void</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LANGUAGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plpgsql </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECLARE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_dr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; v_cr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; v_n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount_minor) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dr_cr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'D'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount_minor) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dr_cr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'C'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_dr, v_cr, v_n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gl_journal_entry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posting_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_posting_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RAISE EXCEPTION </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'empty posting %'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_posting_id; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_dr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_cr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    RAISE EXCEPTION </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unbalanced posting %: dr=% cr=%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_posting_id, v_dr, v_cr;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gl_posting </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posted_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posting_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_posting_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意这里用 <code>amount_minor</code>（整数）而不是小数金额做比较。金额一旦用浮点表示，&quot;借贷平衡&quot;这个不变量就会因为舍入而在某些批次上随机失败——这与 <a href=\"../exception-classify-match/exception-rule-threshold\">例外规则与容差阈值</a> 中&quot;容差必须在最小货币单位上比较&quot;是同一条原则在账务层的体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"挂账的幂等性与重放安全\">挂账的幂等性与重放安全</h2><h3 id=\"为什么重复消费一定发生\">为什么重复消费一定发生</h3><p>分布式系统里&quot;同一条差异被处理两次&quot;不是异常而是常态：消息队列至少一次投递、任务重试、人工补跑、以及最隐蔽的——两个上游系统各自发现同一笔差异并都推送过来。</p>\n<p>因此挂账必须做到：<strong>同一语义事件无论被消费多少次，账上只多一条分录</strong>。实现上有两种力度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>力度</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>能防住</th>\n<th>防不住</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>幂等键唯一约束</td>\n<td><code>UNIQUE (idempotency_key)</code></td>\n<td>完全相同的重复请求</td>\n<td>语义相同但键不同的重复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>差异记录唯一约束</td>\n<td><code>UNIQUE (channel_code, value_date, diff_type, source_ref)</code></td>\n<td>语义重复</td>\n<td>键口径设计不当时的合法并存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两层都要有。第一层挡住技术重复，第二层挡住语义重复。第二层的键设计是难点——它必须让&quot;同一笔差异&quot;有唯一表示，同时又允许真正不同的差异并存（比如同一渠道同一天同一类型的两笔不同短款）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"部分成功的处理\">部分成功的处理</h3><p>挂账批次可能部分成功：分录写入了一半、记账批次未标记完成。幂等键的另一个作用是让重放安全——重放时先查 <code>idempotency_key</code> 是否已存在，存在则直接跳过并校验参数一致性，不存在才执行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;posting_kind&quot;: &quot;suspense_post&quot;,&#10;  &quot;source_type&quot;: &quot;recon_exception&quot;,&#10;  &quot;source_id&quot;: 117833,&#10;  &quot;idempotency_key&quot;: &quot;suspense_post:recon_exception:117833:v1&quot;,&#10;  &quot;entries&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;account_code&quot;: &quot;1241&quot;,&#10;      &quot;auxiliary&quot;: { &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;CH_CARD_ACQ&quot;, &quot;diff_type&quot;: &quot;shortage&quot; },&#10;      &quot;dr_cr&quot;: &quot;D&quot;,&#10;      &quot;amount_minor&quot;: 220,&#10;      &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;account_code&quot;: &quot;2231&quot;,&#10;      &quot;auxiliary&quot;: { &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;CH_CARD_ACQ&quot; },&#10;      &quot;dr_cr&quot;: &quot;C&quot;,&#10;      &quot;amount_minor&quot;: 220,&#10;      &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;narrative&quot;: &quot;挂账：渠道清算短款，待查&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"posting_kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"suspense_post\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"source_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recon_exception\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"source_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">117833</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"idempotency_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"suspense_post:recon_exception:117833:v1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"entries\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"account_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1241\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"auxiliary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CH_CARD_ACQ\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"diff_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"shortage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dr_cr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"D\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"amount_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">220</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"account_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2231\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"auxiliary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CH_CARD_ACQ\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dr_cr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"C\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"amount_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">220</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"narrative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"挂账：渠道清算短款，待查\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>narrative</code> 是给人看的一句话说明，必须写。&quot;待查&quot;三个字在审计时的价值极高——它让审计人能区分&quot;故意未分类&quot;与&quot;漏分类&quot;，前者是设计，后者是缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双边挂账与时间差处理\">双边挂账与时间差处理</h2><p>跨境对账里有一个细节容易被忽略：差异的两侧可能<strong>都需要挂账</strong>。上午渠道文件到达时发现短款，挂一条分录；下午我方支付流水补齐后发现了原因，此时需要挂另一条（或直接核销）。如果只挂一侧，中间这段时间账上其实是不平的——只是不平被藏在&quot;我方流水还没到&quot;这个事实里而没被记录。</p>\n<p>处理方式取决于差异是否只是时间差：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>确认是时间差</strong>（在途）：不挂&quot;待查差异&quot;，进观察窗等待（见 <a href=\"../exception-classify-match/long-short-transit-fee-fx\">长款/短款/在途/手续费/汇率差异</a>），到期未消才挂账。</li>\n<li><strong>不确定是否时间差</strong>：先挂账，观察窗到期后如果自愈则冲销挂账。这样账上任何时刻都是平衡的，代价是多一对分录——这个代价是值得的，因为它换来&quot;任何时点都能平账&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>挂账是真实分录而非状态标记：借贷必须平衡，必须与差异记录一一对应，必须可反向冲销。</li>\n<li>过渡账户按差异类型分主科目、渠道存辅助核算维度，兼顾科目稳定与分析能力。</li>\n<li>幂等要两层：幂等键唯一约束挡技术重复，差异语义唯一约束挡语义重复；键一旦设计好就不能随意改口径。</li>\n<li>借贷平衡用最小货币单位整数比较，浮点会让不变量随机失败。</li>\n<li>时间差先挂账、自愈后冲销，保证任何时点都能平账，而不是&quot;等查清楚再记&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>挂账分录生成后，它离开待查账户需要经过审批——见 <a href=\"writeoff-approval-control\">核销审批与权限</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"挂账分录与过渡账户","id":"挂账分录与过渡账户"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：挂账是记账，不是标记","id":"核心概念-挂账是记账-不是标记"},{"level":2,"text":"过渡账户的设计维度","id":"过渡账户的设计维度"},{"level":3,"text":"按什么维度开账户","id":"按什么维度开账户"},{"level":3,"text":"借贷平衡的强制校验","id":"借贷平衡的强制校验"},{"level":2,"text":"挂账的幂等性与重放安全","id":"挂账的幂等性与重放安全"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么重复消费一定发生","id":"为什么重复消费一定发生"},{"level":3,"text":"部分成功的处理","id":"部分成功的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"双边挂账与时间差处理","id":"双边挂账与时间差处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"工单 SLA 与升级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/case-investigation-sla/case-sla-escalation"},"next":{"title":"核销审批与权限","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/suspense-writeoff/writeoff-approval-control"}}